  "details": "1. Update from widows 10 pro 21h2 to 22h2\n\n2. Open Vrchat in VR using quest 2\n\n3. Frames/graphics are jittery (not a problem with compression or h264/h265 compression)\n\nNothing else changed, and I don't have this problem in any other VR game, even ones that also run on unity.\n\nThis is a problem exclusive to VRChat \n\nI have tried updating drivers, changing versions of compositing software for the quest 2, and I can't roll back to 21h2 because it's end of life.",
